# Raw EXFO JSON scans are local-only: with the current 1M-datapoint sweeps
# they run ~150 MB each, well past GitHub's 100 MB file limit. Only the
# trimmed .npz derivatives (produced alongside each scan) are tracked.
raw_data/*.json

# Raw synthetic data (~25-30 MB each) under simulation/ -- fully
# regeneratable by re-running the commands documented alongside each
# result. Only the lightweight CSV/PNG outputs and summary.csv/.md are
# tracked, same convention as raw_data/ above. (simulation/sim.npz predates
# this rule and stays tracked as-is.)
simulation/**/*.npz
